# Editor directories and files
# Workspace settings hold machine/user-level prefs (TS server memory, terminal
# auto-approve, watcher excludes), so they stay local — never commit them.
# Project-wide tooling config lives in committed files (eslint.config.js,
# tsconfig*.json, vitest*.config.ts, tailwind.config.js).
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

